.TH OMORFOS\-LOCK 1 "" omorfos "omorfos manual"
.nh
.ad l
.ds AD l
.SH NAME
omorfos\-lock \- The lock screen of the omorfos desktop, which asks PAM for each way of unlocking at once
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBomorfos\-lock [COMMAND]\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Without a command it locks the session at once. The \fBlock\fR action starts it so, as \fBlocker\fR in config.yaml names it, and so does the session before the machine sleeps.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBcheck SERVICE USER\fR
Ask PAM's SERVICE whether USER may unlock, as the helper the lock screen starts for each way of unlocking; not for running by hand
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
Print this help
.TP
\fB\-V, \-\-version\fR
Print the version
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBomorfos\fR(1), \fBomorfosctl\fR(1), \fBomorfos\-config\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-keys\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-rules\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-menu\fR(5), \fBomorfos\-theme\fR(5)
